{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1741","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"“一代人有一代人的长征，一代人有一代人的担当。”\n\n今天，新时代的中国青年应当具有怎样的抱负，承担怎样的使命？这些问题值得我们认真思索。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元所选作品，或剖析社会矛盾，宣示历史使命；或概括伟人贡献，致以崇敬之情；或是上书言事，谏阻逐客；或为临终绝笔，直抒心志。这些作品表现出革命导师、有为之士顺应历史潮流，勇于担负时代使命的精神。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，要通过专题研讨，加深对“抱负与使命”的认识。要注意这些作品切于实用、关注特定对象、富于针对性的特点；要结合具体作品，学习有理有据地发表意见，阐发主张；要把握书信注重交流、抒写自由的文体特质，体会作者的深挚情感。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":316376,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/f/f4854ab4d50e4ea1cf08f6fbe1cee3d42bbad1ca.jpeg","height":2386,"id":"media-3812f7942696fbab3f62","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"8ceca79f149cb9b2571866ef595ed98af3547d57034b492ce50aaf498a13ac80","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/f/f4854ab4d50e4ea1cf08f6fbe1cee3d42bbad1ca.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1701}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":11189,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/f/f4854ab4d50e4ea1cf08f6fbe1cee3d42bbad1ca.jpeg","postId":11189,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/f/f4854ab4d50e4ea1cf08f6fbe1cee3d42bbad1ca.jpeg","text":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/f/f4854ab4d50e4ea1cf08f6fbe1cee3d42bbad1ca.jpeg","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":316376,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/f/f4854ab4d50e4ea1cf08f6fbe1cee3d42bb